{"id":"613c2e81b0df","publishedAt":1795217400000,"posts":[[{"bold":true,"text":"【順位戦Ａ級】"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-category-14.html","text":"順位戦"},{"text":" \n 2026/11/20"},{"text":"23:30"},{"text":"47"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"北〕A級順位戦中継局。２勝２敗同士の５回戦。戦型はかつて佐藤九段が名人位へと走る原動力とした横歩取りに。解説は戸辺誠七段に出演いただきます😎。\n\n【将棋ライブ】▲近藤誠也八段ー△佐藤天彦九段【第85期将棋名人戦・A級順位戦】 "},{"size":13,"text":"https://t.co/d2TLjyOU28"},{"size":13,"text":"https://t.co/rTPWAhF8v3"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"— 朝日新聞将棋取材班 (@asahi_shogi) "},{"size":13,"href":"https://x.com/asahi_shogi/status/2123586344169676938?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"November 20, 2026"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n名人戦・順位戦棋譜速報"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"href":"http://www.meijinsen.jp/","text":"http://www.meijinsen.jp/"},{"br":1},{"color":"#333333","size":13,"text":"スポンサーリンク"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n\nＡ級５回戦\n"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n04近藤　誠也（２勝２敗） － 08佐藤　天彦（２勝２敗）\n\n"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"\n引用元："},{"size":10,"text":"https://mevius.5ch.io/test/read.cgi/bgame/1795071710/"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24113.html?sp&m2=form","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24113.html?sp&m2=form","text":"を書く"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24113.html?sp&m2=res","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24113.html?sp&m2=res","text":"(47)"}]],"comments":[]}